WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.170
Welcome to the World's Best Vacation Travel Agency!

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.630
Thank you and congratulations!

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.010
For what?

4
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.910
For being the world's best travel agency.

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.950
Right … thanks.

6
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.530
Trudy, hold my calls.

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.970
I am going to sell our most expensive vacation.

8
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.170
Sure thing, Boss.

9
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.490
The Mountain Getaway is good for you.

10
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.830
It’s a little pricey.

11
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.330
But think of it -- you, on top of a mountain for seven days!

12
00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.210
I’m afraid of high places.

13
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:39.670
Of course you are.

14
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:44.210
That’s why our Deep Sea Adventure is better for you!

15
00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.370
It is pricier than the Mountain Getaway.

16
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.350
Just you and the animals of the sea!

17
00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.130
Shark! Shark!

18
00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.490
No, there are no sharks in your dream vacation!

19
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.430
You need the Safari Camp Out!

20
00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.470
It is our priciest vacation.

21
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.910
But I think it’s the best one for you.

22
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:13.210
During the day, you’ll see elephants, giraffes and lions.

23
00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.170
At night, you’ll sleep out under the stars.

24
00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:23.330
Look, I think this was a bad idea.

25
00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.230
Sure, you can leave.

26
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:31.130
But then you won’t see the latest vacation technology.

27
00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.190
Did you find all of those adjectives?

28
00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.470
Dan started with good - The Mountain Getaway;

29
00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.890
then he moved to better - The Deep Sea Adventure.

30
00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:48.710
And finally, he said the Safari Campout was the best vacation for Anna!

31
00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.650
Exactly what is the “latest vacation technology” … exactly?

32
00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.790
I’m happy you asked.

33
00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.430
Meet the Travel Max 2000!

34
00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:02.550
Wow.

35
00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:05.390
So, tell me, how do you like to travel?

36
00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:11.270
Well, I like travel that is cozy and romantic but still exciting.

37
00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.810
Great. Tell me more.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.250
I like traveling in a plane but not in a helicopter!

39
00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:23.330
Planes are a little scary but helicopters are scarier!

40
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.690
My favorite way of traveling is by train.

41
00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.270
Ships can be the scariest!

42
00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.850
Have you seen the movie “Titanic”?

43
00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.150
Oh, and no horses.

44
00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.310
But I will ride a camel.

45
00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.090
And no bike tours.

46
00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.650
Biking is THE slowest AND least romantic way to travel.
